        "addedAt": "2026-09-02T22:25:35.146Z",
        "description": "\u201cFive adjacent sync and read-model defects were recorded while investigating the outbox ordering bug, including re-evaluation writes that ne\u2026\u201d contradicts \u201cEvery reactor judges every operation at its position in the merged order, so a revocation that sorts earlier retracts an already-accepted o\u2026\u201d. Opened automatically from a CONTRADICTS link \u2014 resolve if one side is right, dissolve if both hold in different contexts.",
